  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nBug is caused by in Document::DoFieldDelay method of third_party\\pdfium\\fpdfsdk\\src\\javascript\\Document.cpp.  \nAttached test case causes Document::DoFieldDelay method to call itself again.  \nSo statement \"delete pData\" in Document::DoFieldDelay is executed twice."
